        form of commercial transaction;
    (c) deployment or operation by or on behalf of a commercial entity (including but
        not limited to corporations, partnerships, and sole proprietorships) for
        purposes of providing goods or services to customers, clients, or end users for
        commercial advantage or monetary compensation;
    (d) redistribution of the Licensed Work or modifications thereto, whether in source
        or object form, as part of a commercial product or service;
    (e) any use, operation, or deployment primarily intended to generate commercial
        advantage or monetary compensation for the entity performing such use, operation,
        or deployment.

1.4 "Permitted Uses" means the uses described in Section 3.

1.5 "Change Date" means the date specified in the Licensed Work's distribution or
    documentation (or if not specified, three (3) years from the date of initial
    release of each version or release), on which the Licensed Work shall automatically
    convert to the Change License.

1.6 "Change License" means the Apache License, Version 2.0, as published by the Apache
